  "prefLabel": "Elec 103.04 Organization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Elec 103.04 Organization. Annually, the board shall elect or appoint a chairperson, vice-chairperson, and secretary who shall be one of the appointed members at the first meeting of the board in a calendar year.\n\nSource. #10354, INTERIM, eff 6-6-13; ss by #10421, eff 9-25-13",
